      "content": "it's not just one thing, it's everything. just everything is so loud and so empty at the same time. i feel like i'm just taking up space that someone else could actually use. like i'm just a burden on everyone around me and i'm tired of trying to fix things that feel unfixable. does that even make sense? it just feels like there's no point to any of it anymore.",
